    "title": "Source: Marianna McCourt leaving Florida State to join staff at UCLA - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Scott Roussel ,\n5 hours ago UCLA Football has added Marianna McCourt to its recruiting staff as the program's new Director of Recruiting Operations source tells FootballScoop. McCourt joins the Bruins after serving as Coordinator of Recruiting Operations at Florida State. In that role, she managed day-to-day recruiting operations for the program under head coach Mike Norvell. Prior to her time at FSU, McCourt gained experience as a student assistant for on-campus recruiting at the University of Mississippi. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
